  "description": "Modbus RTU/ASCII serial protocol library for .NET. Supports binary RTU (CRC-16), ASCII (LRC), and lightweight RtuSimple variants over SerialPort on Windows and Linux. Built on NewLife.IoT standard interfaces with APM tracing support.",
